"variant":"base","index":5,"text":{"ja":"主様のためならば、ゾンビが相手だろうと１歩も引く気はない。かかってこい！！","en":"For the Master's sake, I won't back down even if it's just zombies. Bring it on!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00821_1/uni00821_1_hom_5.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":6,"text":{"ja":"このようなゾンビがはびこる町に来ることになるとはな。だが、この肉体とシヴァがあればどうとでもなるはず……問題はない","en":"Who would've thought I'd end up in a town overrun with zombies? But with this body and Shiva, I can handle anything… no problem at all."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00821_1/uni00821_1_hom_6.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":7,"text":{"ja":"制服姿が似合ってるだと？　ふざけたことを言うな。しかし、このような格好で戦わなければならないとはな……","en":"You think I look good in my uniform? Don't be ridiculous. Still, having to fight in this outfit…"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00821_1/uni00821_1_hom_7.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"r18","index":1,"text":{"ja":"おほぉぉぉっ！　ゾンビに噛まれて感じてるぅっ、魔力吸われてアクメしてしまうぅぅぅ……っ！！","en":"Ohhh! Being bitten by a zombie and feeling it… my magic being drained drives me wild…!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice_r18/uni00821_1_hom_r18_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"r18","index":2,"text":{"ja":"私の制服姿に発情したのか？　もう、すっかりチンポがガチガチになってるじゃないか……さあ、早くブチ込んでくれ……！！","en":"Are you getting turned on by my uniform? Look, your cock's already rock-hard… Come on, thrust it in already!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice_r18/uni00821_1_hom_r18_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"r18","index":3,"text":{"ja":"んはぁぁぁあっ！　マンコをズボズボされながら魔力吸われるのイイ！　イクイクイクぅぅぅ……っ！！","en":"Ahhh! Having my pussy pounded while my magic's being sucked is amazing! I'm coming… coming…!!!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice_r18/uni00821_1_hom_r18_3.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00821_1/uni00821_1_atk_1.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00821_1/uni00821_1_atk_2.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/